      {
        "id": 157287,
        "name": "Kerredai",
        "username": "Kerredai",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/ed8c4c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-30T04:41:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a game against the Dreamer in Silver Gulch this afternoon where, shortly after she flipped, she busted out 2x Dark Hero, 2x Grotesque Arachnoid, a Treacherous Ape, a Whipacorn and an Illusory Demon with the aid of some brutal Violent Nightmares plays. Our team was Chrono-Ranger (me), Bunker, Expatriette and Tempest.</p><p><span>In short order, Chrono-Ranger and Expatriette were down and Bunker and Tempest were not looking good.&nbsp;</span></p><p>We won by the skin of our teeth: we had *just* enough damage, by a single point, to bring down an eight projection -- the last we needed to win -- with Greivous Hail Storm, while Bunker played Adhesive Foam Grenade to keep the environment from killing either the Dreamer<span>&nbsp;or the battered heroes.</span></p><p>Net result, hero victory with Dreamer at 1, Bunker and Tempest at 2. It was&nbsp;<em>very</em> satisfying.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:37:12.076Z",
