        "raw": "<p>I had a game against the Dreamer in Silver Gulch this afternoon where, shortly after she flipped, she busted out 2x Dark Hero, 2x Grotesque Arachnoid, a Treacherous Ape, a Whipacorn and an Illusory Demon with the aid of some brutal Violent Nightmares plays. Our team was Chrono-Ranger (me), Bunker, Expatriette and Tempest.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">In short order, Chrono-Ranger and Expatriette were down and Bunker and Tempest were not looking good.&nbsp;</span></p><p>We won by the skin of our teeth: we had *just* enough damage, by a single point, to bring down an eight projection -- the last we needed to win -- with Greivous Hail Storm, while Bunker played Adhesive Foam Grenade to keep the environment from killing either the Dreamer<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;or the battered heroes.</span></p><p>Net result, hero victory with Dreamer at 1, Bunker and Tempest at 2. It was&nbsp;<em>very</em> satisfying.</p>",
